SUMMARY:MTNS 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:International Symposium on Mathematical Theory of Networks and 
 Systems\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https:/
 /uwaterloo.ca/international-symposium-mathematical-theory-networks-system
 s/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#mtns-2026\nNotes:
  Official pages confirm the 27th MTNS at the University of Waterloo campu
 s\, Aug 17-21\, 2026\, co-sponsored by IFAC. Full papers (4-8 pp\, peer r
 eviewed) go to IFAC-PapersOnLine\; extended abstracts (2-4 pp\, simplifie
 d review) are posted on the site but not published. Invited-session paper
 s needed an organizer's session code. A Feb 12 Wayback snapshot shows the
  same Feb 9/16 dates. No cutoff hour or zone is published\, so cutoffs us
 e provisional end-of-day AoE. Held every two years. ICORE2026 rank C. UW 
 reported 170 attendees\; the program had 144 contributed talks and ten in
 vited sessions. Size is an editorial estimate.
